  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project supports two initiatives:
1.Consumer Literacy Videos, which includes (a) a customer literacy video on insurance to educate customers on available insurance products, and (b) a video on business and livelihood improvement for customers that provides recommendations based on best business practices.
2.Induction and Empowerment Videos focusing on recruitment, professional, and communication skill building, as well as improving collection practices and selling skills.</narrative>
